OL,5,G0200 Casualty 24/7: Every Second Counts
OL,6,     FDuring the night at Barnsley
OL,7,     FCasualty, a pipe bursts, so
OL,8,     Fpatients must be relocated. Among
OL,9,     Fpatients the next day are Pete,
OL,10,     Fwho has dangerously low oxygen
OL,11,     Flevels.
OL,12,G0245 Skin A&E
OL,13,     FDr Dev Shah struggles to treat a
OL,14,     Ffootball fan who has a painful
OL,15,     Fball of fat below his ribcage. Dr
OL,16,     FEmma McMullen deals with a large
OL,17,     Fliquid-filled neck cyst.
OL,18,G0335 Home and Away
OL,19,     FLacey looks to the future. Cash is
OL,20,     Fblindsided by a surprise visitor.
OL,21,     FEden feels out of the loop.
